msgstr "Use KiTheme everywhere"

#: tabs/appearance.c:735
msgid ""
"Escolhe KiTheme para GTK2, GTK3, GTK4 e Qt (depois clique em Aplicar).\n"
"A aparencia do KiTheme se ajusta na aba KiTheme."
msgstr ""
"Selects KiTheme for GTK2, GTK3, GTK4 and Qt (then click Apply).\n"
"KiTheme's look is adjusted in the KiTheme tab."

#: tabs/appearance.c:751
msgid ""
"Recolore os temas GTK e Qt que nao sejam o KiTheme. \"Sem cores "
"personalizadas\" deixa cada tema com as proprias cores. Para criar, editar "
"ou excluir esquemas, use a aba KiTheme."
msgstr ""
"Recolors the GTK and Qt themes other than KiTheme. \"No custom colors\" "
"leaves each theme with its own colors. To create, edit or delete schemes, "
"use the KiTheme tab."

#: tabs/appearance.c:753 tabs/kitheme.c:407
